{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20265r76dUxhrn1794813585.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產元朗區域營業經理王勤學表示，綠表客積極入市，元朗朗屏邨悦屏樓低層34室，實用面積約355平方呎，1房間隔，叫價210萬元，日前以未補價189萬元沽出，實用呎價5324元。<br/>王勤學表示，買家為綠表上車客，心儀朗屏邨交通及起居方便，加上單位開則實用，睇樓後迅速決定入市上址。而原業主於2007年6月以未補價9.81萬元買入單位，持貨約19年，現轉手帳面獲利約179.19萬元，期內升值約18倍。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T06:47:02.587387+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":199,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T06:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T07:20:56.977915+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T06:40:23.007369+00:00","content_hash":"2ca5ab83861cc2675cccab6154f49349a5e623fe4b50eeee17b9bfebd10d8d8e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-18T06:47:02.587387+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}